Z||000004||BellaFiero||07-05-2000||01:52 PM||||- puts on flameproof vest - Okay guys... let me make a small opinion known...<P>...it isn't rice...?<P>Sorry, but I don't think these are rice. Over the top? Sure. But so is my car. And so are some of yours, I'm sure. It is quite possible for two people to own the same exact car, but one is a Rice boy while the other isn't. The big exhaust pipes, the body mods, the paint jobs... if the kid doesn't act like his car just rolled out of Lamborghini's hands, then I have to give him props for such a good job. If he, on the other hand, acts like his car can eat pavement for breakfast and achieve lift-off at 100 miles an hour, and the flux capacitor can kick on and the turbo-charged nitrous bottle will engage and push him to warp 6... well, boil him in water I guess...<P>Take it easy.<P>Jayse||||reg||11
